{"4480140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KILL BREACH", "steam_appid": 4480140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILL BREACH </strong>is a brutal, fast-paced roguelite FPS that combines the ultra fast movement of <strong>Doom Eternal</strong>, the grittiness of <strong>Quake</strong>, and the claustrophobic horde killing of <strong>Black Ops Zombies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/1db1a653724c6a5791ae8674b5519f4f.poster.avif?t=1788025369\" width=690 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/1db1a653724c6a5791ae8674b5519f4f.webm?t=1788025369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/1db1a653724c6a5791ae8674b5519f4f.mp4?t=1788025369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The alien containment facility has fallen. The aliens have escaped, and humanity is at risk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re sent into a fortress overrun with hostile creatures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your way through the fortress and kill anything you find. There’s no one left to save.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve from a soldier into a weapon.</strong> Improve your movement, and abilities. Stack upgrades to build increasingly powerful combinations. The deeper you get into the facility, the more enemies you’ll have to deal with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run is different.</strong> Fight through levels that are randomly generated each time you play, ensuring no two descents into the facility are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Define your challenge before you drop in.</strong> Adjust the room count to suit your playstyle, from bite-sized skirmishes to gruelling endurance marathons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect credits from dead enemies to open weapon crates, which give you weapons ranging from common to legendary rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/2d96219c14070c04fdd0b23ea8c6aef0.avif?t=1788025369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras_big/2d96219c14070c04fdd0b23ea8c6aef0.webp?t=1788025369 width=1560 height=726 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILL BREACH </strong>is a brutal, fast-paced roguelite FPS that combines the ultra fast movement of <strong>Doom Eternal</strong>, the grittiness of <strong>Quake</strong>, and the claustrophobic horde killing of <strong>Black Ops Zombies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/1db1a653724c6a5791ae8674b5519f4f.poster.avif?t=1788025369\" width=690 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/1db1a653724c6a5791ae8674b5519f4f.webm?t=1788025369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/1db1a653724c6a5791ae8674b5519f4f.mp4?t=1788025369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The alien containment facility has fallen. The aliens have escaped, and humanity is at risk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re sent into a fortress overrun with hostile creatures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your way through the fortress and kill anything you find. There’s no one left to save.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve from a soldier into a weapon.</strong> Improve your movement, and abilities. Stack upgrades to build increasingly powerful combinations. The deeper you get into the facility, the more enemies you’ll have to deal with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run is different.</strong> Fight through levels that are randomly generated each time you play, ensuring no two descents into the facility are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Define your challenge before you drop in.</strong> Adjust the room count to suit your playstyle, from bite-sized skirmishes to gruelling endurance marathons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect credits from dead enemies to open weapon crates, which give you weapons ranging from common to legendary rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras/2d96219c14070c04fdd0b23ea8c6aef0.avif?t=1788025369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480140/extras_big/2d96219c14070c04fdd0b23ea8c6aef0.webp?t=1788025369 width=1560 height=726 /></span></p>", "short_description": "KILL BREACH is a brutal, fast-paced roguelite FPS where relentless horde shooting meets infinite weapon upgrades. Infiltrate a randomly generated industrial fortress where no two runs are the same. Turn yourself into a machine of mass destruction, and RIP apart anything that moves.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "http